{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"screens\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把争到没力气后不服气淡了，具体解释成不再争辩自己是否应该离开。完整稿没有明确争辩的对象是离开决定，重点是争持后的不服气逐渐消退。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把舍不得被当自己人改成真心怀念那些人，将眷恋的对象从被接纳、归属感偏移成了具体的人。完整稿强调的是被当作自己人的感受，而不只是怀念那些人本身。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"story\": 3,\n  \"story_note\": \"全曲的事件脉络、情感变化和最终选择基本完全一致，但把不再责怪自己离开、不因怀念而回头，进一步说成接受离开是必要的，略微超出了完整稿的结论；完整稿强调的是同时承认过去的伤害与美好，并带着想念继续生活，而不是断言离开必然是唯一正确的选择。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1dc7c17c-539b-4a08-a777-90a08c62fffd", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T213601551279Z", "elapsed_seconds": 85.047, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T21:37:26.618593+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_a